WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Ito ba ang underworld?

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,680
Mamamatay na ba ako ngayon?

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,560
Napakabata ko pa at hindi ako papayag na sumuko

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,680
Napakainit ng underworld

5
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:16,010
Pati ang lupang hinihigaan mo ay mainit. Hindi ka patay.

6
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:19,920
Mou Chuan, bakit ka nandito?

7
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:21,590
Patay ka na rin ba?

8
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:31,840
Mou Chuan kapatid

9
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,000
Ilang araw na akong hindi kumakain

10
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,800
Maaari mo bang ibahagi sa akin ang ilang karne?

11
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:51,780
Wala kaming sapat na pagkain para sa aming sarili kung wala ang iyong bahagi
